    <title>attachStream()</title>
<indexterm><primary>attachStream</primary><secondary>Assimp::DefaultLogger</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>Assimp::DefaultLogger</primary><secondary>attachStream</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>bool Assimp::DefaultLogger::attachStream (<link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_log_stream">LogStream</link> * pStream, unsigned int severity)<computeroutput>[override]</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>[virtual]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para><para>

<para>Attach a new log-stream.    </para>
</para>

<para>The logger takes ownership of the stream and is responsible for its destruction (which is done using delete when the logger itself is destroyed). Call detachStream to detach a stream and to gain ownership of it again. 
